WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.406
ALEX: Third story — and this one sits in
a different category from

00:00:04.406 --> 00:00:08.812
ALEX: the previous two. Anthropic
announced yesterday what they're calling
the Cyber Mission.

00:00:08.812 --> 00:00:13.217
ALEX: Long-term initiative. The stated
goal is securing the systems society
actually runs

00:00:13.217 --> 00:00:17.623
ALEX: on: power grids, water systems,
transportation networks, government
systems.

00:00:17.733 --> 00:00:21.046
JAMIE: My first instinct was: this is a
good story. Not because it's

00:00:21.046 --> 00:00:24.360
JAMIE: flawless, but because we spend a
lot of time on this show

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:27.673
JAMIE: asking what AI might break. This
is a company saying — here's

00:00:27.673 --> 00:00:30.986
JAMIE: where we want to help hold
something together.

00:00:31.166 --> 00:00:33.901
RUFUS: It is also a company
announcement, so the independent
verification caveat applies

00:00:33.901 --> 00:00:36.636
RUFUS: from the start.
